  "description": "NETWOB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C122 H108 N12 O22 Yb4,2.5(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb7 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb8 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.450-3.801 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.22-112.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(μ3-OH)2L6(acac)4]·2.5CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
